			"object": {
				"@type": "rdf12:LiteralTerm",
				"@value": "[#evidence-note.evidence, status=active]\n== 关系证据说明\n\n关系证据说明用 xref:rule-query-example[规则查询示例, rel=documents] 指向约束规则章节里的 listing target。\n\n关系证据说明也用 xref:required-rule[] 展示默认引用关系。\n\n",
